 "purpose": "A lock file that tells a second copy of the program that one is already open.",
 "details": "Two copies open at once risk lost answers, so the program writes its process id and start time to leeravontuur.lock in the data folder and removes it at exit. A lock whose process no longer runs (power failure) is ignored. The process check differs on Windows (kernel32 through ctypes, because os.kill would terminate the process) and elsewhere (signal 0). Never raises.",
 "module_docstring": "Een slotbestand, zodat het programma merkt dat het al openstaat (twee keer open = kans op verloren antwoorden).",
